WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.502
-Guys, do you ever see a photo
in the news

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.769
and think the headline
could be much better?

00:00:03.769 --> 00:00:04.804
I'll show you what I mean.

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:05.872
It's time for
"News and Improved."

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:07.540
Here we go.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:13.012
-♪ "News and Improved" ♪

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:16.216
-For example,
check out this first photo.

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:17.784
The original headline was...

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.156
The headline can definitely
be improved,

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:24.657
'cause if you only
looked at the photo,

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:25.992
the headline could have been...

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:30.764
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:33.465 --> 00:00:34.801
Check out this next photo here.

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:36.369
The original headline was...

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:40.206
But if you only
looked at the photo,

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.574
the headline could have been...

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:46.279
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:50.917
Up next, this headline says...

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:54.587
Headline could have been...

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.093
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:03.262 --> 00:01:04.530
He's so bummed.
-That kid left.

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.299
-Yes.
"And now the teachers

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:07.700
would like
to perform something."

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:08.868
-Oh, no.

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:11.437
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.437 --> 00:01:13.506
-Why?
We know they can dance.

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:15.174
We just want to see
the kids dance, please.

00:01:15.174 --> 00:01:17.710
-And we'd like to thank
our teachers again.

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:21.547
-With another reprise
of their dance.

00:01:21.547 --> 00:01:23.316
The next headline was...

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:26.920
Headline could have been...

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:30.623
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:34.360
"You see, the second-quarter
numbers are here.

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.996
We gotta get them up here."

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:39.632
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:41.634
Up next, this headline says...

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:45.572
Headline could have been...

00:01:48.407 --> 00:01:49.609
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:50.843
We've all done it.

00:01:50.843 --> 00:01:53.278
Got to learn the hard way.

00:01:53.278 --> 00:01:54.948
This next headline was...

00:01:56.649 --> 00:01:58.284
Headline could have been...

00:02:00.453 --> 00:02:01.654
-Wow!

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:03.656
[ Applause ]

00:02:05.891 --> 00:02:07.494
-Next headline was...

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:11.131
Headline could have been...

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:14.534
It's like...

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:16.302
[ Applause ]

00:02:17.904 --> 00:02:19.572
And finally,
this headline was...

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:22.609
Headline could have been...

00:02:25.578 --> 00:02:27.747
That's all the time we have
for "News and Improved."

